{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1715","id":4139024567,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p872tIC3","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1715","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1715.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1715.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1715","number":1715,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Materialize 9709 KG v0 structural graph","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nStage 1 child #1714 under parent #1713 starts from a verified 3,497-question structural authority, but that authority previously existed only in consolidation ledgers. Downstream product-readback work therefore had no bounded graph projection for Question, QuestionPart, and exact QP/MS evidence identity.\n\nThis PR adds a deterministic, local-artifact-only KG v0 materializer and validator. It:\n\n- authenticates all five formal inputs from the final structural consolidation;\n- conserves 3,497 verified Questions and excludes all 36 safe rejections;\n- reuses all 9,916 existing structural owner identities as QuestionPart nodes;\n- projects 12,396 hash-bound QP/MS EvidenceAnchor nodes;\n- emits 9,916 `HAS_PART` and 36,339 `SUPPORTED_BY` edges;\n- keeps semantic nodes and edges at zero rather than inferring unsupported meaning;\n- isolates `structural`, `candidate`, and `approved` status lanes;\n- records deterministic output hashes, coverage metrics, and all hard-gate counters in one compact release manifest.\n\nThe user-visible effect is a stable structural graph foundation for later product readback without rewriting source authority or prematurely exposing candidate semantics.\n\n## Root cause and fix\n\nThe root cause was the absence of a deterministic graph projection over the checked-in structural ledgers. The new builder authenticates the staging corpus, paper/question/node identity ledgers, and their artifact manifest before materializing any node or edge. Its validator fails closed on duplicate identities, dangling edges, structural orphans, candidate-as-approved exposure, stale authority, and inferred/unsupported edges.\n\nThe implementation has no provider, network, subprocess, production, public, or remote-write surface. It does not perform semantic enrichment and does not authorize Stage 2.\n\n## Authority and custody\n\n- Parent: #1713\n- Stage 1 child: #1714\n- Exact starting `origin/main`: `aca6973739b313ef2723c12dc31fb2d7e4cab1af`\n- PR merge-base: `aca6973739b313ef2723c12dc31fb2d7e4cab1af`\n- Current head: `340edb6f5a371711a2820d4d5e24ca33eeb574a4`\n- Current tree: `fe505090fabcf2fdba130f3824f11aec36b32316`\n- `changed_files=5` (the minimal builder, focused test module, and three outputs)\n- `active_checked_in_output_artifacts=3`\n\n## Release counts\n\n- Nodes: 25,809 total\n  - Question: 3,497\n  - QuestionPart: 9,916\n  - EvidenceAnchor: 12,396\n- Edges: 46,255 total\n  - `HAS_PART`: 9,916\n  - `SUPPORTED_BY`: 36,339\n- Semantic nodes/edges: 0\n- Unclassified questions (non-blocking): 3,497\n\nHard completion gates:\n\n```text\nduplicate_active_identity_count = 0\ndangling_edge_count = 0\nstructural_orphan_count = 0\ncandidate_exposed_as_approved_count = 0\nunsupported_inferred_edge_count = 0\nstale_authority_reference_count = 0\ndeterministic_rebuild = PASS\nverified_input_question_count = 3497\nsafe_rejection_input_count = 0\nstructural_authority_write_count = 0\nprovider_call_count = 0\nremote_write_count = 0\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.test.py` — 15 tests passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.py --check` — byte-identical rebuild passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.py --validate-only` — release validation passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1694_final_consolidation.test.py` — 32 predecessor tests passed\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.py scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.test.py` — passed\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — healthy on the clean, synchronized governed task branch\n\nReview remediation through `340edb6f5` additionally proves that validation rejects a truncated-and-resealed graph, a source manifest not pinned to the declared starting authority, transported node/edge/manifest byte drift, and coordinated falsification of release provenance/contract metadata.\n\nCloses #1714\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T03:29:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T05:57:42Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T05:57:42Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T05:57:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"fca6fbc715f0d0a08d285d083eeacdf24dc743d8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1715/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopil